# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Editors
/.idea/
/.vscode/
*.swp

# The plugin is its own repository — see optioniaWooCommercePlugin/.git
/optioniaWooCommercePlugin/

# The backend is its own repository — see optioniaWooCommerceBackend/.git
/optioniaWooCommerceBackend/

# The dashboard is its own repository — see optioniaWooCommerceFrontend/.git
#
# Missing from this list until 2026-09-10, while the other two had been here from
# the start. It was untracked rather than ignored, so it was exactly the
# "unignored neighbour a broad add could reach" the optionia-app note below
# describes — and it had just received its first real commit, 96 files of Phase
# 13. A `git add -A` here would have nested a git repository inside another.
/optioniaWooCommerceFrontend/

# The Shopify Optionia app is a **separate project** that happens to sit here for
# reference while its features are ported. It has nothing to do with this
# repository and must never be committed into it.
#
# Added after `git add -A` from this directory swept all 357 of its files into a
# WooCommerce commit: the two sub-repos above were already excluded, this was not,
# so it was the one unignored neighbour a broad add could reach.
/optionia-app/
